rum (e.g., EchoStar assets) into commercial carrier partnerships accelerates recurring consumer and enterprise telecom revenue.\",[[0,42,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Operational Milestones: Successful orbital deployment of Starlink V3 satellites via Starship significantly expands network bandwidth per launch, drastically lowering launch cost per kilogram.\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Defense \\u0026 Government Contracts: Ongoing expansion of national security space architecture (Starshield) and crew\",[[0,31,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
