",[[0,31,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Float Expansion \\u0026 Lockup Expiry: The expiration of insider share lockups (e.g., standard 180-day post-offering windows) materially increases tradable float, creating technical selling pressure on equity pricing.\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Capital Expenditure \\u0026 Free Cash Flow Burn: Scaling the Starship manufacturing complex and satellite constellation replacement cycle requires massive reinvestment, pressuring near-term free cash flow margins.\",[[0,42,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Regulatory \\u0026 Orbital Congestion Constraints: Increased scrutiny from the FAA and FCC concerning orbital debris, spectrum interference, and launch license cadence poses potential operational bottlenecks.\",[[0,44,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Citations \\u0026 Sources\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Sacra: SpaceX Valuation \\u0026 Financial Analysis (2026)\",[[0,51,[null,[\"https://sacra.com/c/spacex/valuation/\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"FutureSearch: SpaceX Fair Value \\u0026 Sum-of-the-Parts Forecast\",[[0,59,[null,[\"https://futuresearch.ai/spacex-ipo-valuation/\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"SatNews: SpaceX Valuation Targets \\u0026 Commercial Trajectory\",[[0,57,[null,[\"https://satnews.com/2025/12/10/spacex-targeting-1-5-trillion-valuation-ahead-of-potential-2026-ipo/\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Morningstar: SpaceX Quote \\u0026 Segment Fundamentals\",[[0,48,[null,[\"https://www.morningstar.com/stocks/xnas/spcx/quote\"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,n