[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_8e4b022304d67b5b\",\"r_60a44b76938a3e04\"],null,null,[[\"rc_8b052bde0ee9dc18\",[\"Expert consensus and Wall Street models project SpaceX’s valuation to settle between **$1.3 trillion and $1.8 trillion** by the end of 2026, though market pricing has experienced significant volatility around the $1.5T–$2.1T mark.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Valuation Scenarios (Year-End 2026)\\n\\n| Scenario | Implied Valuation | Core Assumptions / Drivers |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Bull Case** | **$2.0T – $2.5T+** | Rapid cadence of operational Starship launches; accelerated Starlink direct-to-cell adoption; higher tech multiples. |\\n| **Base Case** | **$1.4T – $1.7T** | Sustained Starlink subscriber growth (approaching run-rate profitability); steady Falcon 9 cadence; multiple compression toward sum-of-parts fair value. |\\n| **Bear Case** | **$780B – $1.25T** | Discounted cash flow (DCF) fundamentals taking precedence post-lockup expiry; technical delays on Starship; public market multiple contraction. |\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Key Upside Catalysts\\n\\n1. **Starlink Scaling \\u0026 Direct-to-Device (D2D):** Starlink represents the lion's share of cash flow expansion. Integration of acquired mobile satellite spectrum (e.g., EchoStar assets) into commercial carrier partnerships accelerates recurring consumer and enterprise telecom revenue.\\n2. **Starship Operational Milestones:** Successful orbital deployment of Starlink V3 satellites via Starship significantly expands network bandwidth per launch, drastically lowering launch cost per kilogram.\\n3. **Defense \\u0026 Government Contracts:** Ongoing expansion of national security space architecture (Starshield) and crewed/cargo contracts with NASA providing high-visibility, counter-cyclical revenue streams.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Downside Risks\\n\\n1. **Float Expansion \\u0026 Lockup Expiry:** The expiration of insider share lockups (e.g., standard 180-day post-offering windows) materially increases tradable float, creating technical selling pressure on equity pricing.\\n2. **Capital Expenditure \\u0026 Free Cash Flow Burn:** Scaling the Starship manufacturing complex and satellite constellation replacement cycle requires massive reinvestment, pressuring near-term free cash flow margins.\\n3. **Regulatory \\u0026 Orbital Congestion Constraints:** Increased scrutiny from the FAA and FCC concerning orbital debris, spectrum interference, and launch license cadence poses potential operational bottlenecks.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Citations \\u0026 Sources\\n\\n- [Sacra: SpaceX Valuation \\u0026 Financial Analysis (2026)](https://sacra.com/c/spacex/valuation/)\\n- [FutureSearch: SpaceX Fair Value \\u0026 Sum-of-the-Parts Forecast](https://futuresearch.ai/spacex-ipo-valuation/)\\n- [SatNews: SpaceX Valuation Targets \\u0026 Commercial Trajectory](https://satnews.com/2025/12/10/spacex-targeting-1-5-trillion-valuation-ahead-of-potential-2026-ipo/)\\n- [Morningstar: SpaceX Quote \\u0026 Segment Fundamentals](https://www.morningstar.com/stocks/xnas/spcx/quote)\"],[null,[[[\"Successful orbital deployment of Starlink V3 satellites via Starship significantly expands network bandwidth per launch, drastically lowering launch cost per kilogram.\",null,null,[[1266,1433],[1256,1423]]],[1],[[\"https://sacra.com/c/spacex/valuation/#:~:text\\u003dSpaceX's%20Starship%20to%20Launch%20and%20Deploy%2026,1%20Tbps%20of%20bandwidth.%20The%20Verge.%20Flag.\",\"SpaceX: $800.00B valuation [2026] - Sacra\",\"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/favicon-tbn?q\\u003dtbn%3AANd9GcR8QMJuVIfUAOh36uus4XNWrCbx9XhO5YfslPH_-d5N8F5ofU08yHo9pFIfcisF5oso4HIT29jsuf8JkF2QvhFF2ZVxXw\",\" SpaceX's Starship to Launch and Deploy 26 Satellites on September 22, \\n2026. This mission will enhance Starlink's capacity by 3%, with each of the \\n26 V3 satelli...\",[[\"Successful orbital deployment of Starlink V3 satellites via Starship significantly expands network bandwidth per launch, drastically lowering launch cost per kilogram.\",null,null,[[1266,1433],[1256,1423]]]],null,\"Sacra\",9,\"\"]],\"spp_8614ef8884ca463e\"],[[\"The expiration of insider share lockups (e.g., standard 180-day post-offering windows) materially increases tradable float, creating technical selling pressure on equity pricing.\",null,null,[[1708,1886],[1698,1876]]],[1],[[\"https://futuresearch.ai/spacex-ipo-valuation/#:~:text\\u003dThe%20first%20real%20test%20of%20float%20scarcity,much%20as%2058%25%2C%20roughly%20fourteenfold%20(Business%20Insider).\",\"SpaceX IPO Price and Stock Forecast to 2027 - FutureSearch.ai\",\"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/favicon-tbn?q\\u003dtbn%3AANd9GcSkI5map2N83cdlh7gYqnn0S7FuCnZ1bwILJgMZecYQtLS3-BHnXPsadUQq6dcFLpVzMuBrKK5BeIa2YzZLjgiIT1lStbvOdFcsgg\",\"The first real test of float scarcity arrived with the earnings tape rather \\nthan the unlock itself. * Around November 2026. The first audited earnings \\nreport, a...\",[[\"The expiration of insider share lockups (e.g., standard 180-day post-offering windows) materially increases tradable float, creating technical selling pressure on equity pricing.\",null,null,[[1708,1886],[1698,1876]]]],null,\"FutureSearch.ai\",9,\"\"]],\"spp_eb2d07b27fe3435b\"]]],null,null,null,null,null,[2],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,true,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[[[],\"Searched the web\",\"Google Search\",\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg/v6/192px.svg\",[],\"Searched the web\",\"\",[[\"https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://satnews.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://satnews.com/2025/12/10/spacex-targeting-1-5-trillion-valuation-ahead-of-potential-2026-ipo/\",\"SpaceX Targeting $1.5 Trillion Valuation Ahead of Potential 2026 IPO\",null,[]],[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://sacra.com/\\u0026client\\u003d